for its relentless pursuit of its motto, “Let the noble thoughts come to us from all directions,” which reflects its openness to diverse perspectives, cultures, and values in its academic and organizational spheres. \n1380- \n--\n1412- \n1413- \n1414- Home \n1415- \n1416- \n1417- \n1418: About the University\n1419- \n1420- \n1421- \n1422- \n1423- Home\n1424- \n1425- \n1426- \n1427: \n1428- Introduction\n1429- \n1430- \n1431- \n1432- \n1433- Vision & Mission\n=== page-1.html / established ===\n346- Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University \n347- \n348- \n349- \n350- Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University \n351- दीनदयाल उपाध्याय गोरखपुर विश्‍वविद्यालय --> \n352: A state university established under the Uttar Pradesh State Universities Act, 1973 --> \n353- (Accredited A++ by NAAC) \n354- \n355- \n356- \n357- \n358- \n4:        <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;&#32;charset=UTF-8\" />\r\n5:        <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\" />\r\n6:        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,&#32;initial-scale=1.0\" />\r\n47:                Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\r\n49:            <meta name=\"description\" content=\"The University aspires to excel as a University of Excellence in the coming years by combining value based ethical education with modern scientific education & march ahead in the path of academic progress contributing to the social, economic, political, cultural & educational development of the region.\" />\r\n50:            <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/\" />\r\n51:            <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/\" />\r\n52:            <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n53:            <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\" />\r\n54:            <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The University aspires to excel as a University of Excellence in the coming years by combining value based ethical education with modern scientific education & march ahead in the path of academic progress contributing to the social, economic, political, cultural & educational development of the region.\" />\r\n55:            <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"images/facebook-home.png\" />\r\n56:            <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n57:            <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/\" />\r\n58:            <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/\" />\r\n59:            <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"The University aspires to excel as a University of Excellence in the coming years by combining value based ethical education with modern scientific education & march ahead in the path of academic progress contributing to the social, economic, political, cultural & educational development of the region.\" />\r\n60:            <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\" />\r\n61:            <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/images/twiter-home.png\" />\r\n62:            <meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-09-27\" />\r\n116:    <div class=\"homecontent\">\r\n340:                                <!--<a href=\"index.php\"><img src=\"images/logo.png\" alt=\" Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\" title=\" Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\" class=\"img-responsive\" /> </a>-->\r\n341:                                <a href=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/index.php\"><img src=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/images/main-logo.jpeg\" alt=\" Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\" title=\" Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\" class=\"img-responsive logosize\"/> </a>\r\n346:                            <h4 class=\"logoname logohindiname\"><strong>Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University</strong></h4>\r\n350:                            <!--                                <h3 class=\"logoname logoenglishname\">Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University</h3>\r\n352:                            <!--<div class=\"logosubtitle\" style=\"color: #b75906;font-size: 15px;\"/>A state university established under the Uttar Pradesh State Universities Act, 1973</div>-->\r\n357:                            <center><img src=\"images/CATEGORY_281123.jpg\" alt=\" Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\" title=\" Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University\" class=\"img-responsive\" /></center>\r\n363:                            <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/DDUGorakhpurUniv\" style=\"margin-left: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/images/facebook.png\" class=\"img-responsive\" style=\"max-width: 30px;\"/></a>\r\n413:                                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/DDUGorakhpurUniv\" style=\"margin-left: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/images/facebook.png\" class=\"img-responsive\" style=\"max-width: 30px;\"/></a>\r\n426:                                            <li><a href=\"https://ddugu.ac.in/about-us.php\">Introduction</a></li>\r\n1071:                                            <li><a href=\"https://erp.ddugu.ac.in/epathshala_content.aspx\">E-PathShala</a></li>\r\n1298:        <div class=\"modal-content\">\n1345:                    <h3>Introduction</h3>\n1379:                                            Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University, founded in 1950, is the first university in Uttar Pradesh to emerge as a leading higher-studies centre after Independence. It has earned an A++ accreditation from NAAC for its relentless pursuit of its motto, “Let the noble thoughts come to us from all directions,” which reflects its openness to diverse perspectives, cultures, and values in its academic and organizational spheres.   \n1383:                                            The university bears the name of the eminent political philosopher, Pandit Deen Dayal Upadhyaya. It is situated in Gorakhpur, where it draws inspiration from the spiritual, philosophical, patriotic, and philanthropic heritage of Gautam Buddha, Sant Kabir, Guru Gorakshnath, Bismil, Hanuman Prasad Poddar, and the world-famous Gita Press.    \n1387:                                            The university spans 190.96 acres and comprises eight faculties with forty departments that have been instrumental in providing holistic education to the people of Eastern Uttar Pradesh, Western Bihar, and Nepal since its inception. As a residential-cum-affiliating State University with academic jurisdiction over three districts of Eastern Uttar Pradesh, it boasts of a rich academic legacy, distinguished alumni, competent, qualified, and committed faculty members, transparent and efficient administrative system, ample career growth opportunities, advanced research facilities, and a lively and secure campus.\n1395:                                            The university is furnished with facilities such as an automated Central Library, ICT-enabled classrooms, state-of-the-art laboratories, an Incubation centre, Health Centre, separate hostels for men and women, facilities for sports and games, an environment-friendly campus, a gender-sensitive environment, and a ragging-free atmosphere.\n1428:                        Introduction\n1567:                            <p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 500;\">Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University</p>\r\n1568:                            <!--<p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 500;line-height: 0.9;padding-top: 11px;\">Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University</p>-->\r\n1570:                            <p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 15px;font-weight: 500;\">सिविल लाइंस, गोरखपुर - 273009, उत्तर प्रदेश (भारत)</p>\r\n1571:                            <p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 13px;font-weight: 500;\">Civil Lines, Gorakhpur - 273009, Uttar Pradesh (INDIA)</p>\r\n1572:                            <!--<p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 13px;font-weight: 500;\">Civil Lines, Gorakhpur - 273009, Uttar Pradesh (INDIA)</p>-->\r\n1573:                            <!--<p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 13px;font-weight: 500;\">सिविल लाइंस, गोरखपुर - 273009, उत्तर प्रदेश (भारत)</p>-->\r\n1613:                            <p class=\"dateupdate\">Copyright © Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Gorakhpur University. </p>\r\n1644:            $('.skiper').attr('href', mk + \"#main-content\");\r\n1672:                     content : '<div class=\"fancybox-image\" style=\"background-image:url(' + this.href + '); background-size: cover; background-position:50% 50%;background-repeat:no-repeat;height:100%;width:100%;\" /></div>'\r\n1729:                        contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n1793:                    $(\".bhoechie-tab>.bhoechie-tab-content\").removeClass(\"active\");\r\n1794:                    $(\".bhoechie-tab>.bhoechie-tab-content\").eq(index).addClass(\"active\");\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
